{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2298071/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2298071/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね、高校生活最後の体育祭でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまりそこまで暑くなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、ちょうど良いお天気で、誰一人ぷりぷりすることなかった！！よかたよかた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でーすーが、10人11脚の時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん気合いを入れすぎましてあみあみ足首をまーぁ派手にぎっくりいってまいまちた  (´༎ຶ۝༎ຶ)いでっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識がたりんね意識が。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、どれをとっても楽しく楽しくてしょうがなかったから、良い思い出って事よ(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいでね、気になる結果は......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？準優勝でごわす。にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあいろんな事があったけども、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果オーライじゃ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返す！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/11/2298071/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.割り箸くわえて何やってんの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.せっちゃんとのやつかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはにぃ、「ちょっとあみ、変な事やってみて。」って言われたから、くわえてみた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみテニスしたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ないっ！そういえばまだない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー楽しいのかな？？やってみたい(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.乃木坂でも総選挙やりたいと思う？それともやりたくない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.正直、総選挙を自らやりたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう方はなかなか少ないんじゃないかな？あみは...んーこわい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあのプレッシャーに勝った人にしかわからない感動や喜びをあみも味わってみたいな。とは思います(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみはコンビニのパスタ食べたりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.前まではよぉーく食べてた！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今はね、ヘルシー思考になってきてるから、食べないようにしてる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみは総選挙見てたの～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろん、見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっと鳥肌がたってて、いつのまにか涙がでてました。乃木坂46とはどういうグループなのか。改めて深く考えさせられました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.他のメンバーの握手行ってみたいやけど...(/_・、)どう思いますか？(*^^*)(笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えっ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなぁー乃木坂可愛い子多いからなあ（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.省エネで何かやってることあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.前まで、そこまで意識した事なかったんだけど、今は本当にささいな事をものすごく気を付けてるよ！トイレのふたを必ず閉じるとかね(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.Ａさんに告白されたんですがＢさんの事が好きです、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｂさんと付き合ったらＡさんとＢさんの友達関係とかって崩れたりしますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えー難しい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ＡさんとＢさんの間で心から楽しい会話は出来なくなるかもね...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.定期以外に今まで大事なものをなくした事あるぅ!?(*^.^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ない！定期が史上最強に大事な忘れ物だた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.察するに、あみあみインドア派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.いえす。あいあむインドア。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、最近はアウトドアになろうと試みてるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.皆が歌ってる曲の中で、自分の声って分かるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.わかる時はわかる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからない時は全くわからん！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいあみ！！"}],"source":"archive"}